WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.940
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.020
 I grew up in New York City.

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:09.360
The streets were paved
with different colors

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:10.620
of broken glass.

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:12.720
Our bikes would
catch flats a lot.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:17.760
But it was the
terrain of champions.

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:20.790
Making music and rhymes was
extremely therapeutic for what

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:23.570
I was seeing in the streets.

00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:25.550
While Hip-Hop was
always truthful,

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:28.970
it uncovered the ugliness
in American society

00:00:28.970 --> 00:00:31.940
from the man on the ground.

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:36.590
I'm going to create a brand
new song just for MasterClass.

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:38.630
You'll see my writing
process in real-time.

00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:44.590
(RAPPING) Yeah, test one, two.

00:00:44.590 --> 00:00:46.780
Big Nas, old money, new money.

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:49.240
I'll be teaching you how
to find your inspiration,

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:50.320
find your flow--

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:52.270
(RAPPING) Me, myself, I'm
the illest alive.

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:55.450
--and how to turn your life
experiences into music.

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:58.120
(RAPPING) I hear my calling heart
pounding out my chest.

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:01.540
As a young man, my raps
were about me still

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:04.510
maintaining my sanity
on a beautiful level

00:01:04.510 --> 00:01:06.280
in this ugly world.

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:09.130
You are the one that
can change your reality

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:14.470
and uplift the art of rhyming
by being brave and bold enough

00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:16.810
to try to do something
that hasn't been done.

00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:19.420
(RAPPING) I've got more styles and more
flows, plus I'm much flyer.

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:20.170
I got more--

00:01:20.170 --> 00:01:22.510
Go into a quiet room,
buckle your seatbelt,

00:01:22.510 --> 00:01:24.190
and get ready for this ride.

00:01:24.190 --> 00:01:26.360
(RAPPING) We can light up.

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:30.930
I'm Nas, and this
is MasterClass.

